### AUDIT MODE EXAMPLE
### npm run start:dev (without DB) or:
### DATABASE_URL=postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5433/audit_example npm run start:dev

### Get info
GET http://localhost:3000

### Get status
GET http://localhost:3000/status

###
### ORDER FLOW
###

### Place an order
POST http://localhost:3000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-123",
  "items": [{"productId": "laptop", "quantity": 1}],
  "total": 999.99
}

### Get all orders (from OrderService - source of truth)
GET http://localhost:3000/orders

### Get order by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/orders/order-XXXXX

### Cancel order
POST http://localhost:3000/orders/order-XXXXX/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requested cancellation"
}

###
### AUDIT LOG (requires DATABASE_URL)
###

### View audit log
GET http://localhost:3000/audit
